   "widgets_values": [
    "## Qwen-Image 2.1 \u00b7 Text to Image (uncensored)\n**Model:** `UC Q8_0 GGUF` by default (near-lossless). Flip the yellow switch to `true` to use `UC FP8` instead \u2014 only the selected loader is loaded.\n\n**Size:** ResolutionSelector drives the latent. 1.0 MP \u2248 1024\u00b2, **4.0 MP = native 2048\u00b2**. Keep multiples of 32.\n\n**Transparent (RGBA) output:** wrap the prompt like\n`This is an RGBA format image with transparency. [your subject]. The image has an alpha channel and a transparent background.`\n\n**Sampling:** cfg **1** (official; negative prompt is ignored at cfg 1 \u2014 raise cfg only if you use one). Steps **40** (official 40\u201350 w/ euler; 25 is the Comfy template's faster default)."
   ],
   "title": "Notes"
  }
